          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fbfbfb; --card:#ffffff; --accent:#5b8c7a; --muted:#6b6b6b; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --radius:12px; --max-width:980px; --mono:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, \\\"Roboto Mono\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Mono\\\";\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial; background:var(--bg); color:#162018; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    header{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(91,140,122,0.06), rgba(91,140,122,0.02)); padding:28px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(20,20,20,0.02);}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max-width); margin:0 auto;}\\n    nav{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6fff7,#eaf7f0);display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(20,20,20,0.04)}\\n    .logo svg{width:32px;height:32px}\\n    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\\n    .nav-links a:hover{background:rgba(91,140,122,0.06);color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    main{padding:36px 20px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    @media (max-width:920px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(16,24,18,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:24px}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .contact-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(91,140,122,0.08),rgba(91,140,122,0.04));font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    /* session + blend area */\\n    .widget{display:grid;gap:14px}\\n    .widget h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin:6px 0}\\n    input[type=text], select, textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.06);background:transparent}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .row .col{flex:1}\\n    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(16,16,16,0.06);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}\\n\\n    /* blend card visual */\\n    .blend-card{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffb);border:1px solid rgba(91,140,122,0.06)}\\n    .swatch{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:8px;flex:0 0 64px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:800}\\n    .card-body{flex:1}\\n    .recipes{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:#233226;margin-top:8px}\\n\\n    /* subtle pattern using inline svg background */\\n    .pattern-wrap{border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}\\n    .pattern-wrap::before{content:\\\"\\\";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 160\\\"><defs><pattern id=\\\"p\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(25)\\\"><rect width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"%23f7fff9\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"6\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\" fill=\\\"%235b8c7a\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"34\\\" cy=\\\"34\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\" fill=\\\"%235b8c7a\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/></pattern></defs><rect width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" fill=\\\"url(%23p)\\\"/></svg>');opacity:0.6;mix-blend-mode:multiply}\\n\\n    footer{padding:28px 20px;background:transparent;border-top:1px solid rgba(16,16,16,0.02);color:var(--muted)}\\n    small{display:block;color:var(--muted);}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n      <nav>\\n        <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><rect x=\\\"3\\\" y=\\\"3\\\" width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" rx=\\\"5\\\" fill=\\\"#eaf7f0\\\"/><path d=\\\"M6 16c2-4 7-4 9 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#237b63\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/><path d=\\\"M8 9c1.5-2 4-2 5.5 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#2b856c\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n            <small style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</small>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"nav-links\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Studio</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Practices</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Formulas</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Market</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Roots</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);\\\">Reach Out</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h1>Reach the team — plan an event or a personal session</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">If you have questions about workshops, seasonal pop-ups, or a tailored aromatherapy pathway, tell us a few details below. We’ll reply with options and timing.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-info\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Call: {{PHONE}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Located: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <hr style=\\\"margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(16,16,16,0.04)\\\" />\\n\\n        <form onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();handleContact(this)\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Jane Doe\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message / inquiry</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us what you’re hoping for — event date range, audience size, or personal goals\\\"></textarea>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Quick booking link</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:14px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card pattern-wrap\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"widget\\\">\\n            <h3>Session Planner</h3>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Build a brief plan for a personalized aromatherapy series. Export a plaintext summary to share or save.</p>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"goal\\\">Primary intention</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"goal\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"calm\\\">Calm & reduce reactivity</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"focus\\\">Improve focus for short sessions</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"sleep\\\">Support better sleep transition</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"energy\\\">Lift low energy</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"events\\\">Event scent design (group)</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"length\\\">Session length</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"length\\\">\\n                  <option value=\\\"30\\\">30 minutes</option>\\n                  <option value=\\\"45\\\">45 minutes</option>\\n                  <option value=\\\"60\\\">60 minutes</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"frequency\\\">Frequency</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"frequency\\\">\\n                  <option value=\\\"single\\\">Single session</option>\\n                  <option value=\\\"3wk\\\">3 sessions over 3 weeks</option>\\n                  <option value=\\\"6wk\\\">6-session series (recommended)</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"vibe\\\">Preferred scent direction</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"vibe\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"herbal\\\">Herbal & green</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"citrus\\\">Bright citrus</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"warm\\\">Warm resinous</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"floral\\\">Soft floral</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"notes\\\">Any notes for accessibility / sensitivities</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"notes\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"sensitivities, pregnancy, pets in home, scent-free preferences\\\" />\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"primary\\\" onclick=\\\"buildPlan()\\\">Draft plan</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"ghost\\\" onclick=\\\"resetPlanner()\\\">Reset</button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"planOutput\\\">Plan summary</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"planOutput\\\" rows=\\\"6\\\" readonly placeholder=\\\"Your session plan will appear here\\\"></textarea>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <small style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Tweak then copy — share this as a summary when you contact us.</small>\\n              <div>\\n                <button class=\\\"ghost\\\" onclick=\\\"copyText('planOutput')\\\">Copy</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"widget\\\">\\n            <h3>Blend Builder (quick)</h3>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Choose a vibe and who will use the blend. The tool gives a safe dilution guide and a printable blend card. Not medical advice — informational only.</p>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"blendVibe\\\">Vibe</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"blendVibe\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"calm\\\">Calm presence</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"focus\\\">Focus & clarity</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"uplift\\\">Uplift & brighten</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"sleep\\\">Sleep ritual</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"audience\\\">Who is this for?</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"audience\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"adult\\\">Adult (recommended)</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"child\\\">Child (2+ years)</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"pregnant\\\">Pregnant / breastfeeding (use caution)</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"pet\\\">Pet environment (consult vet)</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"container\\\">Container size</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"container\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"10\\\">10 mL roller</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"30\\\">30 mL bottle</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"primary\\\" onclick=\\\"makeBlend()\\\">Generate blend</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"ghost\\\" onclick=\\\"resetBlend()\\\">Clear</button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div id=\\\"blendResultArea\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;display:none\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"blend-card\\\">\\n                <div id=\\\"swatch\\\" class=\\\"swatch\\\">B</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n                  <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\"><strong id=\\\"blendTitle\\\">Morning Bright</strong><small id=\\\"diluteNote\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\"></small></div>\\n                  <div id=\\\"blendDesc\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px\\\">Brief description of the suggested blend.</div>\\n                  <div class=\\\"recipes\\\" id=\\\"recipeList\\\"></div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;justify-content:flex-end\\\">\\n                <button class=\\\"ghost\\\" onclick=\\\"copyBlend()\\\">Copy blend card</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"primary\\\" onclick=\\\"printBlend()\\\">Print</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <small style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Always perform a patch test and follow dilution guidance. If pregnant or caring for animals, consult a qualified provider.</small>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Common misunderstandings</h3>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Myth:</strong> Strong scent equals better results.\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Truth: Subtle, intentional doses often produce the most reliable responses. We favor measured, safe use over intensity.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Myth:</strong> One blend fits everyone.\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Truth: Personal history, sensitivities, and context change how a blend may affect someone. We create flexible pathways, not one-size-fits-all formulas.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Myth:</strong> Aromatherapy replaces medical care.\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Truth: Aromatherapy may support wellbeing but is not a substitute for medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card pattern-wrap\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Core approach</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">We combine event-style scent design with short personal series to build repeatable, accessible scent habits. Sessions include education, scent exposure design, and take-home guidance.</p>\\n        <ul style=\\\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li>Safety-first dilution and patch testing</li>\\n          <li>Small-exposure scent planning for habit-building</li>\\n          <li>Simple take-home blend cards and guides</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3>Notes from sessions</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Summary notes and anonymized examples from workshops and short series. These are illustrative and not clinical records.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffb);border:1px solid rgba(16,16,16,0.04)\\\">\\n            <strong>Group: Evening Reset (pop-up)</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We set two scent stations — a soft citrus welcome and a low-intensity resinous evening station. Participants rated their sense of calm higher after a ten-minute guided practice. Notes focus on accessibility and scent layering.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffef8);border:1px solid rgba(16,16,16,0.04)\\\">\\n            <strong>1:1 Series: Micro-focus pathway</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Three short sessions focused on scent anchors and brief attention cues. Participants kept a one-week scent log to notice small shifts in focus and reactivity. Descriptions below show blend evolution and at-home adaptation.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3>FAQ — safety & guidance</h3>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>How do you decide dilution?</strong>\\n            <div>We use conservative dilutions by default. Typical adult short-term topical blends range from 1–3% depending on use and skin sensitivity. Child, pregnant, and pet-related guidance is more cautious; see the blend builder and always patch test.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>What is a patch test?</strong>\\n            <div>You apply a small diluted drop to an inconspicuous area (inside forearm) and watch for 24 hours. No redness, itching, or swelling should occur. If irritation appears, discontinue use.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Pets and essential oils</strong>\\n            <div>Certain essential oils can be harmful to animals. We recommend consulting your veterinarian before diffuse or topical use near pets. For household scent, use very low concentrations and good ventilation.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Pregnancy and breastfeeding</strong>\\n            <div>Some oils are not recommended during pregnancy. If you are pregnant or breastfeeding, consult a qualified health provider before beginning aromatherapy. We provide lower concentration options and alternative approaches.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Ready to plan?</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Share a few details and we’ll propose dates and a suggested pathway. Booking includes a short intake and your first session materials.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-block\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>\\n        <small> — Practical scent events & small-series programs</small>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <div>Phone: {{PHONE}}</div>\\n        <div>Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // Session Planner\\n    function buildPlan(){\\n      const name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'Client';\\n      const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value;\\n      const length = document.getElementById('length').value;\\n      const freq = document.getElementById('frequency').value;\\n      const vibe = document.getElementById('vibe').value;\\n      const notes = document.getElementById('notes').value || 'None noted.';\\n\\n      const goalMap = {\\n        calm: 'Calm & reduced reactivity',\\n        focus: 'Short-term focus enhancement',\\n        sleep: 'Improved sleep transition',\\n        energy: 'Gentle energy lift',\\n        events: 'Event scent design (group)'\\n      };\\n\\n      const freqMap = {\\n        single: 'Single session',\\n        '3wk': 'Three sessions over three weeks',\\n        '6wk': 'Six-session series (recommended)'\\n      };\\n\\n      const planLines = [];\\n      planLines.push(`${name} — Session Planner summary`);\\n      planLines.push('Intention: ' + goalMap[goal]);\\n      planLines.push('Session length: ' + length + ' minutes');\\n      planLines.push('Frequency: ' + freqMap[freq]);\\n      planLines.push('Vibe direction: ' + vibe);\\n      planLines.push('Accessibility / notes: ' + notes);\\n      planLines.push('Next steps: We will propose available dates and a short intake call to confirm preferences and sensitivities. No medical claims are made — this plan is educational and may support personal wellbeing.');\\n\\n      const out = planLines.join('\\\\n');\\n      document.getElementById('planOutput').value = out;\\n    }\\n\\n    function resetPlanner(){\\n      document.getElementById('goal').selectedIndex = 0;\\n      document.getElementById('length').selectedIndex = 0;\\n      document.getElementById('frequency').selectedIndex = 0;\\n      document.getElementById('vibe').selectedIndex = 0;\\n      document.getElementById('notes').value = '';\\n      document.getElementById('planOutput').value = '';\\n    }\\n\\n    function copyText(id){\\n      const el = document.getElementById(id);\\n      if(!el) return;\\n      navigator.clipboard.writeText(el.value).then(()=>{\\n        alert('Copied to clipboard');\\n      }).catch(()=>alert('Copy failed'));\\n    }\\n\\n    function handleContact(form){\\n      const name = form.name.value;\\n      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. We received your inquiry and will reply to ' + form.email.value + '.');\\n      form.reset();\\n    }\\n\\n    // Blend builder logic\\n    const blendPresets = {\\n      calm: {title:'Calm Presence', desc:'Soft, grounding notes for gentle settling', color:'#6da48f', oils:['Lavender','Bergamot','Frankincense']},\\n      focus: {title:'Focus Clarity', desc:'Crisp, clear top notes to support alertness', color:'#d4a646', oils:['Rosemary','Peppermint','Sweet Basil']},\\n      uplift: {title:'Bright Lift', desc:'Sunny citrus blend to refresh mood', color:'#f3b33d', oils:['Sweet Orange','Grapefruit','Petitgrain']},\\n      sleep: {title:'Evening Ease', desc:'Low-odour, soothing anchors to ease transition to rest', color:'#7b9ab0', oils:['Roman Chamomile','Lavender','Sandalwood']}\\n    };\\n\\n    function makeBlend(){\\n      const vibe = document.getElementById('blendVibe').value;\\n      const audience = document.getElementById('audience').value;\\n      const container = Number(document.getElementById('container').value);\\n\\n      const preset = blendPresets[vibe];\\n      if(!preset) return;\\n\\n      // dilution guidance\\n      let dilution = 2; // percent default for adults\\n      let note = 'Suggested dilution: 2% (adult topical guideline)';\\n      if(audience === 'child'){\\n        dilution = 0.75; note = 'Suggested dilution: 0.5–1% (child guidance)';\\n      } else if(audience === 'pregnant'){\\n        dilution = 0.5; note = 'Suggested dilution: 0.5% or consult provider (pregnancy/breastfeeding caution)';\\n      } else if(audience === 'pet'){\\n        dilution = 0.25; note = 'Pet-safe approach: use very low concentrations and consult a veterinarian. Certain oils are unsafe for animals.';\\n      }\\n\\n      // calculate drops for container: approximate 20 drops per mL\\n      const dropsPerMl = 20;\\n      const totalDrops = Math.round(container * dropsPerMl * (dilution / 100));\\n\\n      // distribute across oils\\n      const oils = preset.oils.slice(0,3);\\n      const baseDrops = Math.floor(totalDrops / oils.length) || 1;\\n      const remainder = totalDrops - baseDrops * oils.length;\\n      const recipe = oils.map((oil, i) => ({oil, drops: baseDrops + (i < remainder ? 1 : 0)}));\\n\\n      // safe-language description\\n      const desc = `${preset.desc}. This suggested blend may support the chosen intention. Not medical advice.`;\\n\\n      // populate UI\\n      document.getElementById('blendResultArea').style.display = 'block';\\n      document.getElementById('blendTitle').textContent = preset.title;\\n      document.getElementById('blendDesc').textContent = desc;\\n      document.getElementById('diluteNote').textContent = note;\\n      document.getElementById('swatch').style.background = preset.color;\\n      document.getElementById('swatch').textContent = preset.title.split(' ').map(w=>w[0]).join('');\\n\\n      const recipeEl = document.getElementById('recipeList');\\n      recipeEl.textContent = '';\\n      recipe.forEach(r=>{\\n        const line = `${r.oil}: ${r.drops} drop${r.drops!==1?'s':''}`;\\n        const node = document.createElement('div');\\n        node.textContent = line;\\n        recipeEl.appendChild(node);\\n      });\\n\\n      // store current blend for copy\\n      window._currentBlend = {\\n        title: preset.title,\\n        desc,\\n        dilution: note,\\n        container: container + ' mL',\\n        recipe\\n      };\\n    }\\n\\n    function resetBlend(){\\n      document.getElementById('blendVibe').selectedIndex = 0;\\n      document.getElementById('audience').selectedIndex = 0;\\n      document.getElementById('container').selectedIndex = 0;\\n      document.getElementById('blendResultArea').style.display = 'none';\\n      window._currentBlend = null;\\n    }\\n\\n    function copyBlend(){\\n      if(!window._currentBlend) return alert('No blend to copy');\\n      const b = window._currentBlend;\\n      const lines = [];\\n      lines.push(b.title);\\n      lines.push(b.desc);\\n      lines.push('Container: ' + b.container);\\n      lines.push('Dilution note: ' + b.dilution);\\n      lines.push('Recipe:');\\n      b.recipe.forEach(r=>lines.push('- ' + r.oil + ': ' + r.drops + ' drop' + (r.drops!==1?'s':'')));\\n      lines.push('Patch test recommended. If pregnant, nursing, or caring for pets, consult a qualified provider. This information is educational and may support wellbeing, not medical advice.');\\n      const text = lines.join('\\\\n');\\n      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>alert('Blend copied to clipboard')).catch(()=>alert('Copy failed'));\\n    }\\n\\n    function printBlend(){\\n      if(!window._currentBlend) return alert('Nothing to print');\\n      const b = window._currentBlend;\\n      const w = window.open('','_blank');\\n      const html = `<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><title>${b.title}</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:20px;color:#162018}h1{font-size:20px}pre{font-family:monospace;background:#f6f6f6;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}</style></head><body><h1>${b.title}</h1><p>${b.desc}</p><p><strong>${b.dilution}</strong></p><pre>${b.recipe.map(r=>r.oil+': '+r.drops+' drops').join('\\\\n')}</pre><p>Patch test recommended. Consult provider for pregnancy or pets. Educational use only.</p></body></html>`;\\n      w.document.write(html); w.document.close(); w.print();\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact page and interactive tools — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page (contact.html) for a small aromatherapy practitioner's website. It is created with a minimal, local-first approach: no external assets, no images, and no CDN dependencies. Replace placeholders ({{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}) with your real data.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — the full contact page with interactive widgets and FAQ.\\n\\nHow to run locally:\\n1. Place contact.html in the root of a simple static site folder alongside the other site pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) if you have them.\\n2. Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari).\\n3. No build steps required — everything is client-side.\\n\\nFeatures implemented on contact.html:\\n- Responsive contact layout with practical copy and safety-first language.\\n- Session Planner widget:\\n  - Choose intention, session length, and frequency.\\n  - Drafts a plaintext plan summary in the browser.\\n  - Copy the summary to clipboard to paste into an inquiry or save locally.\\n- Blend Builder (quick):\\n  - Choose a vibe (calm, focus, uplift, sleep), who the blend is for (adult, child, pregnant, pet), and a container size.\\n  - The tool calculates a conservative dilution and a drops-based recipe (approximate) for the chosen container.\\n  - Displays a visual blend card and allows copying the blend card as plain text or printing it.\\n  - All output uses safety-forward language: \\\"may support\\\", patch-test reminders, and consult-a-provider guidance for pregnancy/pets.\\n\\nDesign notes and constraints:\\n- Minimal, zen-minimal visual language; a subtle inline SVG pattern is embedded as a data URL to create texture without external files.\\n- Unique navigation labels (Studio, Practices, Formulas, Market, Investment, Our Roots, Reserve, Reach Out) that link to the correct page filenames.\\n- All interactive behavior is implemented in vanilla JavaScript to keep the page self-contained.\\n\\nSafety and legal:\\n- This page intentionally avoids medical claims. Language such as \\\"may support\\\" and \\\"educational only\\\" is used throughout.\\n- The FAQ includes instructions about dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy.\\n- The Blend Builder is informative and not a substitute for a consultation with a qualified aromatherapist or medical professional.\\n\\nCustomizing and extending:\\n- To add more blend presets, edit the `blendPresets` object in the <script> section of contact.html.\\n- To change dilution defaults, adjust the logic in `makeBlend()`.\\n- To integrate server-side form handling, replace the form `onsubmit` handler with a normal POST to your backend endpoint and secure it as needed.\\n\\nAccessibility:\\n- Simple semantic HTML with form labels and reasonable contrast for body text.\\n- All copy/copy-to-clipboard actions are confirmed with alerts; you can replace these with non-blocking toasts if desired.\\n\\nNotes for deployment:\\n- Because everything is local, serve the files with any static server (for example, `python -m http.server` or a local dev server).\\n- Remember to replace placeholders with live contact and booking information before publishing.\\n\\nIf you want a second chunk (other pages or assets like a dedicated SVG file), request the next build and list which files should be included.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
